        "text": "The Corner Stage accepted your booking request — one step left to finalize it.\n ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿\n\nBOOKING REQUEST ACCEPTED\n\nThe Corner Stage wants to book you\n\nGood news — The Corner Stage accepted the booking request you sent for The Midnight Ramblers. To finalize the booking, claim your request on Ithas Fire: create a free account (or sign in if you already have one), turn on performer mode, and the booking agreement picks up right where you left off.\n\nClaim your booking request [https://ithasfire.com/booking-requests/claim/tok_abc123def456]\n\nThis link expires on August 12, 2026 at 12:00 AM UTC and can only be used once.\n\nNot ready yet? No problem — the place has your email and can reach you directly. If you weren't expecting this, you can safely ignore this message.\n\nIthas Fire [https://ithasfire.live]"
