    "text": "Corner Booking Collective changed the bill they pitched to The Corner Stage.\n ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿\n\nBILLS YOU'RE ON\n\nCorner Booking Collective took Paper Moth off the bill at The Corner Stage\n\nCorner Booking Collective changed the bill they pitched to The Corner Stage, and Paper Moth is no longer on it.\n\nPLACE\n\nThe Corner Stage\n\nDATES\n\nFri, Aug 14, 2026\n\nThere's nothing you need to do.\n\nYou're receiving this because Paper Moth joined a bill on Ithas Fire. You can turn off \"Bills you're on\" emails in your notification settings.\n\nIthas Fire [https://ithasfire.live]",
