        "text": "Sam Rivera put you on a lineup\n ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿\n\nSam Rivera put you on a lineup\n\nEvent: Friday Night Sessions\n\nWhen: Friday, October 9, 2026 at 8:00 PM (Chicago time)\n\nAs: Performer\n\nYour name shows on the event page and in your profile's upcoming shows. If you didn't agree to this, or the details are wrong, you can take yourself off the lineup. The organiser will be told.\n\nReview your lineups [https://ithasfire.com/my-lineups]\n\nYou're getting this because someone added your Ithas Fire profile to an event. You can't turn these off, so you know where your name appears.\n\nIthas Fire [https://ithasfire.live]"
