    "text": "Install the Scanner app and sign in as operator@example.com to start scanning for Sunset Collective.\n ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿\n\nScanner setup\n\nInstall the Ithas Fire Scanner\n\nYou've been added to Sunset Collective as a Scanner. Use the Ithas Fire Scanner app to check tickets at the door.\n\niOS / iPadOS\n\nApp Store · TestFlight\n\nInstall on iPhone [https://testflight.apple.com/join/abcd1234]\n\nAndroid\n\nGoogle Play · internal-track\n\nInstall on Android [https://play.google.com/apps/internaltest/scanner]\n\nSign in\n\nOpen the app, choose Magic link, and enter:\n\noperator@example.com\n\nYou'll receive a sign-in email — tap the link on the same device and you're in.\n\n----------------------------------------\n\nLost your invitation? Ask the Sunset Collective admin to resend it from the Scanner Setup page.\n\nSent via Ithas Fire\n\nIthas Fire [https://ithasfire.live]",
