        "text": "Thanks for signing up to volunteer at Night Market Sessions.\n ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿ ‌ ‍‎‏﻿\n\nSignup received\n\nThanks for signing up to volunteer\n\nThanks for signing up to help at Night Market Sessions. We've recorded your interest in the Door greeter role.\n\nStatus: Your signup is pending review\n\nRole: Door greeter\n\nShift: Evening\n\nWhen: May 2, 2026, 5:00 PM – May 2, 2026, 9:00 PM\n\nFinish setting up your account so you can manage this signup.\n\nComplete your account [https://ithasfire.com/auth/complete?email=volunteer%40example.com&src=volunteer&event=evt_123]\n\nHave questions? Reply to this email to reach the organizer.\n\nIthas Fire [https://ithasfire.live]"
